            "in": "query",
            "description": "The Q-Code or selection code such as QOBCE to obtain obstacle related NOTAMs.<p>Adding a Q-Code parameter will return only NOTAMS with the specified Q-Code.</p><b>Q-Code rules:</b><ul><li>MUST start with a 'Q'</li><li>MUST be five characters</li></ul>",
            "required": false,
